---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout title="404 · 页面未找到" description="抱歉，你访问的页面未曾收录。">
  <section class="max-w-xl mx-auto px-5 sm:px-8 py-28 text-center">
    <span class="wuji-seal w-10 h-10 text-base mx-auto mb-6">空</span>
    <p class="text-xs font-mono tracking-[0.26em] text-[var(--text-muted)]">404</p>
    <h1 class="mt-3 text-3xl sm:text-4xl font-bold text-[var(--text-primary)] font-editorial">
      此卷无字
    </h1>
    <p class="mt-4 text-sm text-[var(--text-secondary)] leading-relaxed">
      你访问的地址可能已迁移或尚未落墨。不妨回到首页，或按 <kbd class="px-1.5 py-0.5 text-xs font-mono border border-[var(--border-hairline)] rounded-[2px]">⌘K</kbd> 检索全站。
    </p>
    <div class="mt-8 flex items-center justify-center gap-5 text-sm">
      <a
        href="/"
        class="px-5 py-2 bg-[var(--ink-primary)] text-[var(--bg-canvas)] rounded-[3px] hover:opacity-88 transition-opacity"
      >
        返回首页
      </a>
      <a
        href="/blog/"
        class="text-[var(--text-secondary)] hover:text-[var(--accent-seal)] border-b border-[var(--border-strong)] pb-0.5 transition-colors"
      >
        浏览文集
      </a>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
